A file that opens with a `---` thematic break, and has another `---` further down, has no
frontmatter when the lines between hold no YAML mapping (here a comment and a plain scalar, as
YAML reads `# Title` and `Some text.`): they are body text, so `# Title` is listed.
== args
input/breaks.md
== file input/breaks.md
---
# Title

Some text.

---

## More
== stdout
input/breaks.md (8 lines)
[L2-L8] # Title
[L8-L8] ## More
== stderr
== exit 0
